{"shortDescription":"RNS Number : 0991V  Sunrise Resources Plc  17 September 2026   \t\t\t\t\t17 September 2026SUNRISE RESOURCES plc(“Sunrise” or the “Company”)Fundraising and Restoration of TradingDirector/PDMR HoldingsFurther to its announcement of 9 September 2026, when the Company entered a Capital Access Window trading…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":["RNS Number : 0991V  Sunrise Resources Plc  17 September 2026   \t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["17 September 2026"]},{"type":"p","children":["SUNRISE RESOURCES plc"]},{"type":"p","children":["(“Sunrise” or the “Company”)"]},{"type":"p","children":["Fundraising and Restoration of Trading"]},{"type":"p","children":["Director/PDMR Holdings"]},{"type":"p","children":["Further to its announcement of 9 September 2026, when the Company entered a Capital Access Window trading halt, Sunrise Resources plc (AIM: SRES), wishes to announce that it has conditionally raised £320,000 before expenses (“the Placing”) through the issue of 2,133,333,330 new Ordinary Shares of 0.001p each (the \"Placing Shares”) at the price of 0.015 pence per Placing Share (the “Placing Price”)."]},{"type":"p","children":["The issue of the Placing Shares is conditional only on their admission to trading on AIM (“Admission”)."]},{"type":"p","children":["The Placing was arranged through the Company’s broker, AlbR Capital Limited (“AlbR”)."]},{"type":"p","children":["Each Placing Share will be issued with one warrant (the “Placing Warrants”) which will entitle the holder to apply for one new Ordinary Share in the capital of the Company at a price of 0.0175 pence per share at any time within 12 months from the date of issue. Should the average closing mid-market price of the Company's Ordinary Shares on AIM be equal to or greater than 0.0225 pence for five consecutive trading days from the date of issue of the Placing Warrants, the Company has the option to serve notice on the warrant holders to exercise the Placing Warrants and any Placing Warrants remaining unexercised after seven calendar days following the issue of such notice will be cancelled."]},{"type":"p","children":["The issue of the Placing Shares is subject to Shareholder approval and a Shareholder Circular and a Notice of General Meeting will be issued in due course."]},{"type":"p","children":["Following this announcement, the Capital Access Window has now closed and trading in the Company's Ordinary Shares on AIM will resume at 7:30 a.m. on 17 September 2026."]},{"type":"p","children":["Directors Participation"]},{"type":"p","children":["Mr Patrick Cheetham, Executive Chairman of the Company, and Mr Adam Hainsworth, a non-executive director of the Company, have participated in the Placing and have subscribed £15,000 for 100,000,000 Placing Shares and £20,000 for 133,333,333 Placing Shares respectively. Their interests in the capital of the Company following Admission is as shown in the following table:"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Director"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Number of"]},{"type":"p","children":["Placing and"]},{"type":"p","children":["Additional Shares"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Total interest in"]},{"type":"p","children":["Ordinary Shares"]},{"type":"p","children":["Following"]},{"type":"p","children":["Admission"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["% of Company's"]},{"type":"p","children":["issued share"]},{"type":"p","children":["capital following"]},{"type":"p","children":["Admission"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Patrick Cheetham"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["100,000,000"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["992,995,526"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["8.63%"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Adam Hainsworth"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["133,333,333"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["665,529,265"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["5.78%"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]}]}]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Broker Warrants"]},{"type":"p","children":["Under the terms of its engagement dated 1 October 2025, AlbR will be issued with 106,666,667 warrants (the “Broker Warrants”), each Broker Warrant entitling the holder to apply for one new Ordinary Share at the Placing Price at any time within 12 months from the date of Admission."]},{"type":"p","children":["Use of Proceeds"]},{"type":"p","children":["The net funds raised pursuant to the Placing will be applied to general working capital and to advance the Company’s preparatory work for drill testing of various gold and base metal projects held in Nevada, USA and Australia. This includes geophysical exploration at the Reese Ridge and Lake projects in Nevada, USA."]},{"type":"p","children":["Admission"]},{"type":"p","children":["Application is being made for the Placing Shares, which will rank pari passu with all existing Ordinary Shares, to be admitted to trading on AIM and Admission is expected to occur on or around 23 September 2026."]},{"type":"p","children":["Total Voting Rights"]},{"type":"p","children":["For the purposes of the Disclosure and Transparency Rules of the Financial Conduct Authority, the Board of Sunrise hereby notifies the market that further to Admission of the Placing Shares, the Company's issued share capital will consist of 11,508,466,366 Ordinary Shares with a nominal value of 0.001p each, with voting rights (\"Ordinary Shares\"). The Company does not hold any Ordinary Shares in Treasury. Therefore, the total number of Ordinary Shares in the Company with voting rights will be 11,508,466,366 This figure may be used by shareholders in the Company as denominator for the calculations by which they may determine if they are required to notify their interest in, or a change to their interest in, the Company under the Financial Conduct Authority's Disclosure Guidance and Transparency Rules."]},{"type":"p","children":["Further information:"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Sunrise Resources plc"]},{"type":"p","children":["Patrick Cheetham, Executive Chairman"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Tel: +44 (0)1625 838 884"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Beaumont Cornish Limited"]},{"type":"p","children":["Nominated Adviser"]},{"type":"p","children":["James Biddle/Roland Cornish"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Tel: +44 (0)207 628 3396"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["AlbR Capital Limited"]},{"type":"p","children":["Broker"]},{"type":"p","children":["Lucy Williams/Duncan Vasey"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Tel: +44 (0)207 469 0930"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]}]}]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Market Abuse Regulation (MAR) Disclosure"]},{"type":"p","children":["The information contained within this announcement is d